(4792800, 693098, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great sunset!  I don''t like the composition with the trees in the middle--without any shadow detail, they draw my eyes from the subject (the sunset) and leave me wanting more.  Try a shadow/highlight mask next time, and if that still doesnt work, then your best bet is an uninterrupted horizon.</td>', 'Great sunset!  I don''t like the composition with the trees in the middle--without any shadow detail, they draw my eyes from the subject (the sunset) and leave me wanting more.  Try a shadow/highlight mask next time, and if that still doesnt work, then your best bet is an uninterrupted horizon.', '2008-07-01 01:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
