(4792884, 686470, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot all around. The street lights appear to be floating on their own and they, along with the bridge, appear to be protruding out from the base tower. The crop places all of the elements as an anchor at the bottom of the image and the empty space at the top is clean and smooth. Also unique about this shot is the absence of color - virtually greyscale except for the gold glow of the tower.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot all around. The street lights appear to be floating on their own and they, along with the bridge, appear to be protruding out from the base tower. The crop places all of the elements as an anchor at the bottom of the image and the empty space at the top is clean and smooth. Also unique about this shot is the absence of color - virtually greyscale except for the gold glow of the tower.', '2008-07-01 02:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792885, 693342, 84520, '<td valign="top">Its neat, but it doesn''t do much for me.  Maybe a giant propane fireball!</td>', 'Its neat, but it doesn''t do much for me.  Maybe a giant propane fireball!', '2008-07-01 02:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
