(4792915, 690617, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast around the crown of the head. Nice shadows around the arm. Good catch lights in the eyes. Together they give a nice three dimensional feel. Red is a nice touch ... adds a dynamic feel. Crop might be a little tight, especially near the top of the head.</td>', 'I like the contrast around the crown of the head. Nice shadows around the arm. Good catch lights in the eyes. Together they give a nice three dimensional feel. Red is a nice touch ... adds a dynamic feel. Crop might be a little tight, especially near the top of the head.', '2008-07-01 02:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
