(4792919, 693580, 18197, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture. I love gliders, and this wonderfully captures man''s contest with lift, gravity, speed and drag. GREAT!!!</td>', 'Incredible capture. I love gliders, and this wonderfully captures man''s contest with lift, gravity, speed and drag. GREAT!!!', '2008-07-01 02:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
