(4792929, 689408, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image. Love the tilt! Reflections are terrific. Contrast and saturation are extraordinary. The waves add a dynamic feel to this. Very difficult to imagine how to improve!</td>', 'Fantastic image. Love the tilt! Reflections are terrific. Contrast and saturation are extraordinary. The waves add a dynamic feel to this. Very difficult to imagine how to improve!', '2008-07-01 02:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792932, 690310, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nostalgic. I like the subject, the composition, the B&amp;W. All very good. Maybe a little over sharpened. Soften that a bit and you''ve got a 10.<br/> <br/>Normally I detest a letter box frame, but in this case, with the B&amp;W and subject, it works splendidly. Thanks for daring to be out of the box a bit!</td>', 'Very nostalgic. I like the subject, the composition, the B&W. All very good. Maybe a little over sharpened. Soften that a bit and you''ve got a 10. Normally I detest a letter box frame, but in this case, with the B&W and subject, it works splendidly. Thanks for daring to be out of the box a bit!', '2008-07-01 02:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
