(4795502, 685483, 14867, '<td valign="top">Fill flash excessive IMO (particulary with the shadow just beyond), the contrats is too strong and the color balance unnatural between the cold foreground and warm background.</td>', 'Fill flash excessive IMO (particulary with the shadow just beyond), the contrats is too strong and the color balance unnatural between the cold foreground and warm background.', '2008-07-01 18:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
