(4796261, 689961, 46177, '<td valign="top">I love the soft glow of the grasses and her position is perfect, very beautiful form you can feel the movement of the breeze. My only small critique would be her eye being so black but perhaps you meant it to be that way.  I am sure I will come back and look again, anyway its very pretty.</td>', 'I love the soft glow of the grasses and her position is perfect, very beautiful form you can feel the movement of the breeze. My only small critique would be her eye being so black but perhaps you meant it to be that way.  I am sure I will come back and look again, anyway its very pretty.', '2008-07-01 23:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4796262, 692739, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the rocks and the water.  I think if you could have used an ND filter, or polarizer to slow the shutter speed down, (and used a tripod if you did not), the water wouldn''t look so "harsh" and the rocks would be in better focus.  I think it would give it a more "polished" look.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the rocks and the water.  I think if you could have used an ND filter, or polarizer to slow the shutter speed down, (and used a tripod if you did not), the water wouldn''t look so "harsh" and the rocks would be in better focus.  I think it would give it a more "polished" look.', '2008-07-01 23:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
