(4797551, 691031, 80904, '<td valign="top">ha! I have been on Mt Evans and I know how hard is to follow these slow goats that are used to people (lack of air). Good effort, but a bit boring. Maybe because the goat is not looking at you. Then again the question is...since they have wool. Are they goats or are they sheep? :)</td>', 'ha! I have been on Mt Evans and I know how hard is to follow these slow goats that are used to people (lack of air). Good effort, but a bit boring. Maybe because the goat is not looking at you. Then again the question is...since they have wool. Are they goats or are they sheep? :)', '2008-07-02 09:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4797557, 686815, 80904, '<td valign="top">the effect kinda bugs me. Mabe if she was sharp.</td>', 'the effect kinda bugs me. Mabe if she was sharp.', '2008-07-02 09:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
