(4799129, 691954, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 7/7/10 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/5 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:5/5 <br/>Presentation: 7 <br/>Total: 6.5<br/>Vote: 7 <br/> <br/>Remarks: an utterly wonderful and captivating story. Title provides context without diminishing the mystery. -The subject''s expression and demeanor is absolutely riveting, btw.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 7/7/10 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/5 Aesthetics/Technical:5/5 Presentation: 7 Total: 6.5Vote: 7  Remarks: an utterly wonderful and captivating story. Title provides context without diminishing the mystery. -The subject''s expression and demeanor is absolutely riveting, btw.', '2008-07-02 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799151, 692619, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/5/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:7/6 <br/>Presentation: 7 <br/>Total: 6.1<br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: an amusing understatement. -I imagine Thomas Mann would have enjoyed the hotel...</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/5/6 Aesthetics/Technical:7/6 Presentation: 7 Total: 6.1Vote: 6  Remarks: an amusing understatement. -I imagine Thomas Mann would have enjoyed the hotel...', '2008-07-02 17:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799160, 693745, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 7/6/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/7 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:7/7 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total: 6.4<br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: the subject appears to have prompted all manner and treatment. The result, to my sense, is a wonderful and sincerely felt cohesion of elements.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 7/6/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/7 Aesthetics/Technical:7/7 Presentation: 6 Total: 6.4Vote: 6  Remarks: the subject appears to have prompted all manner and treatment. The result, to my sense, is a wonderful and sincerely felt cohesion of elements.', '2008-07-02 17:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799183, 685587, 54645, '<td valign="top">Good potential, I like the composition. Not much in focus or it was lost in the HDR/tonemapping PP. It''s an odd visual experience to see highlights in the midground bricks when they should be in the shadow of the building due to the position of the sun. I really like the concept and composition.</td>', 'Good potential, I like the composition. Not much in focus or it was lost in the HDR/tonemapping PP. It''s an odd visual experience to see highlights in the midground bricks when they should be in the shadow of the building due to the position of the sun. I really like the concept and composition.', '2008-07-02 17:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
