(4800517, 693781, 43191, '<td valign="top">She looks cold ( goose bumps on her torso). I would probably have preferd this with her clothes on as to me she looks very young. She has an interesting expresion on her face and the traditional hair and make-up make for a unique and striking portrait. However the naked body pulls your attention away from her face and the image simply becomes a nude rather than a portrait. Does that make sense? This is all just my oppinion of course. Good luck :)</td>', 'She looks cold ( goose bumps on her torso). I would probably have preferd this with her clothes on as to me she looks very young. She has an interesting expresion on her face and the traditional hair and make-up make for a unique and striking portrait. However the naked body pulls your attention away from her face and the image simply becomes a nude rather than a portrait. Does that make sense? This is all just my oppinion of course. Good luck :)', '2008-07-03 03:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4800518, 692205, 43191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little too busy. My eye doesn''t know where to settle in the frame. Good luck :)</td>', 'Nice shot but a little too busy. My eye doesn''t know where to settle in the frame. Good luck :)', '2008-07-03 03:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
