(4801111, 693061, 7786, '<td valign="top">Love the texture and the simple color specturum of it. Would have loved to see more of the tracks to lead you throughout the image. Over all a brilliant image.</td>', 'Love the texture and the simple color specturum of it. Would have loved to see more of the tracks to lead you throughout the image. Over all a brilliant image.', '2008-07-03 14:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4801120, 693196, 7786, '<td valign="top">The colors and combosition are great. Great work with the sharp details of the parts in focus but IMO the DOF is to short. The image is a complex combination of in and out of focus parts. A deeper DOF would have rendered more of the interesting parts of the flower in focus as well as the more of the bee.</td>', 'The colors and combosition are great. Great work with the sharp details of the parts in focus but IMO the DOF is to short. The image is a complex combination of in and out of focus parts. A deeper DOF would have rendered more of the interesting parts of the flower in focus as well as the more of the bee.', '2008-07-03 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4801128, 685483, 7786, '<td valign="top">A beautiful place and good idea but you need to work on the details to go all the way. The foreground cactus is to dominating in the image. It overshadows the beautiful backdrop. Try to make your foreground object more subtle. The lighting on the catus is also unatural, try using an lightweight protable reflector you can get a more naturally balanced light on your foreground subjects.</td>', 'A beautiful place and good idea but you need to work on the details to go all the way. The foreground cactus is to dominating in the image. It overshadows the beautiful backdrop. Try to make your foreground object more subtle. The lighting on the catus is also unatural, try using an lightweight protable reflector you can get a more naturally balanced light on your foreground subjects.', '2008-07-03 14:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4801135, 693443, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. Very Picture-postcard-esque.</td>', 'Nice DOF. Very Picture-postcard-esque.', '2008-07-03 15:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
