(4803249, 688693, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image but the processing makes it look like two separate images have been combined together when I''m sure that''s not the case. It''s the dark halo around the insect that particularly looks "wrong". But compositionally I like it.</td>', 'Nice image but the processing makes it look like two separate images have been combined together when I''m sure that''s not the case. It''s the dark halo around the insect that particularly looks "wrong". But compositionally I like it.', '2008-07-04 20:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803251, 693399, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait composition and the way that the vastness is made evident by the haze-faded distant rocks. The silhouetted tourists provide the perfect focal point.</td>', 'I like the portrait composition and the way that the vastness is made evident by the haze-faded distant rocks. The silhouetted tourists provide the perfect focal point.', '2008-07-04 20:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803254, 693649, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail, wonderful background colours, great composition (the way the wings are cropped out doesn''t bother me and infact it serves to make the portrait seem that much more intimate). Really nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful detail, wonderful background colours, great composition (the way the wings are cropped out doesn''t bother me and infact it serves to make the portrait seem that much more intimate). Really nice job!', '2008-07-04 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803257, 693763, 3087, '<td valign="top">Colours seem strongly overprocessed leading to a particularly odd posterisation at the edge between the top dark band and the pink clouds. Composition and content are otherwise good.</td>', 'Colours seem strongly overprocessed leading to a particularly odd posterisation at the edge between the top dark band and the pink clouds. Composition and content are otherwise good.', '2008-07-04 20:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803258, 692203, 3087, '<td valign="top">That eye contact is just wonderful and the expression so genuine I can''t help but smile back!</td>', 'That eye contact is just wonderful and the expression so genuine I can''t help but smile back!', '2008-07-04 20:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803261, 690955, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully relaxing image. That one single bird makes such a perfect focal point, though I wish it were a touch sharper given that it is the focal point.</td>', 'What a wonderfully relaxing image. That one single bird makes such a perfect focal point, though I wish it were a touch sharper given that it is the focal point.', '2008-07-04 20:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803263, 689888, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of natural light and I love the warm tone of the image. The pose, bent forward as she is, looks dreadfully uncomfortable. Eye contact is nice.</td>', 'Lovely use of natural light and I love the warm tone of the image. The pose, bent forward as she is, looks dreadfully uncomfortable. Eye contact is nice.', '2008-07-04 20:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803265, 691546, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s an amazing contrast between a city falling into darkness, with lights ablaze, and the ocean and sky, still so full of the day''s last light.</td>', 'Wow, that''s an amazing contrast between a city falling into darkness, with lights ablaze, and the ocean and sky, still so full of the day''s last light.', '2008-07-04 20:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803268, 692050, 3087, '<td valign="top">That''s an impressive storm cloud coming in with the little plane bravely landing through it but the processing seems to be rather overdone with the strangest yellowy-green outline along the edge of that white sky opening at the right. The sunlight on the grass provides lovely colour richness.</td>', 'That''s an impressive storm cloud coming in with the little plane bravely landing through it but the processing seems to be rather overdone with the strangest yellowy-green outline along the edge of that white sky opening at the right. The sunlight on the grass provides lovely colour richness.', '2008-07-04 20:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803269, 693846, 3087, '<td valign="top">That sky is just beautiful.</td>', 'That sky is just beautiful.', '2008-07-04 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803271, 693719, 3087, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful animal. I like the black and white conversion.</td>', 'Such a beautiful animal. I like the black and white conversion.', '2008-07-04 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803274, 693633, 3087, '<td valign="top">That S curve within the main plant creates a lovely composition. The colours are very soothing.</td>', 'That S curve within the main plant creates a lovely composition. The colours are very soothing.', '2008-07-04 20:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803276, 688462, 3087, '<td valign="top">Is he actually thanking you or asking you not to take his picture?</td>', 'Is he actually thanking you or asking you not to take his picture?', '2008-07-04 20:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803277, 692795, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful night time exposure. It feels very tranquil. The composition works really well with the trunk on the third and the foliage framing the river and opposite bank.</td>', 'Beautiful night time exposure. It feels very tranquil. The composition works really well with the trunk on the third and the foliage framing the river and opposite bank.', '2008-07-04 20:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803279, 693138, 3087, '<td valign="top">That towering brick wall definitely adds to the depression implied by his facial expression and slumped pose.</td>', 'That towering brick wall definitely adds to the depression implied by his facial expression and slumped pose.', '2008-07-04 20:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803282, 693708, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the tourist telescope to create a foreground for what could otherwise be a somewhat boring postcard picture. It really gives a sense of place and it also presents the scene as a tourist attraction -- one can imagine an interested visitor getting his coin out ready to use the ''scope.</td>', 'I like the use of the tourist telescope to create a foreground for what could otherwise be a somewhat boring postcard picture. It really gives a sense of place and it also presents the scene as a tourist attraction -- one can imagine an interested visitor getting his coin out ready to use the ''scope.', '2008-07-04 20:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803303, 693685, 86799, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  Would love to be enjoying this place in a canoe or kayak.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  Would love to be enjoying this place in a canoe or kayak.', '2008-07-04 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803308, 693715, 86799, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly captured the feeling.  Wow.  Great shot.</td>', 'You''ve certainly captured the feeling.  Wow.  Great shot.', '2008-07-04 20:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4803492, 693635, 43191, '<td valign="top">Interesting story being told here.</td>', 'Interesting story being told here.', '2008-07-04 23:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
