(4806173, 688496, 82985, '<td valign="top">okay, it would seem snarky to say this is the best Duck Portrait I have ever seen--since it is the ONLY duck portrait I have ever seen.  So let me follow with: WOW--this is very out-of-the box: how many would have thought to do a Duck Portrait, and then if they did, how many would have done such a perfect and beautiful one?  I am guessing the answer, amazingly enough is One, and then One again.  And this is also, portraiture aside, this is the best image of a duck I have ever seen.  10</td>', 'okay, it would seem snarky to say this is the best Duck Portrait I have ever seen--since it is the ONLY duck portrait I have ever seen.  So let me follow with: WOW--this is very out-of-the box: how many would have thought to do a Duck Portrait, and then if they did, how many would have done such a perfect and beautiful one?  I am guessing the answer, amazingly enough is One, and then One again.  And this is also, portraiture aside, this is the best image of a duck I have ever seen.  10', '2008-07-06 01:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
