(4806393, 686815, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I recognise that truck, and that pose, and that hat, and that barn...  Still don''t know who''s shot this is, but I''ve got a bit of cowboy deja vu here...  :)  I''ll have to go and look after I pick a score...  Ah yes, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=70265" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">stevieian</a>.  I like the other crop without the trees, but this image is larger, which is nice.  I''d still prefer to see her face.  :)</td>', 'Hmm, I recognise that truck, and that pose, and that hat, and that barn...  Still don''t know who''s shot this is, but I''ve got a bit of cowboy deja vu here...  :)  I''ll have to go and look after I pick a score...  Ah yes,  stevieian.  I like the other crop without the trees, but this image is larger, which is nice.  I''d still prefer to see her face.  :)', '2008-07-06 03:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
