(4806708, 693758, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oyster Catchers always amuse me - they are such unlikely looking birds!  Its a crisp catcher, and mildly amusing with the bird on the car bonnet.</td>', 'Oyster Catchers always amuse me - they are such unlikely looking birds!  Its a crisp catcher, and mildly amusing with the bird on the car bonnet.', '2008-07-06 10:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
