(4806879, 693663, 21124, '<td valign="top">Although you will probably score low, in my opinion this high key portrait is technically very good, perfectly exposed.<br/>Composition is a bit too centered for my taste, I would have prefered a bit more space on the left and just a bit less on the right.</td>', 'Although you will probably score low, in my opinion this high key portrait is technically very good, perfectly exposed.Composition is a bit too centered for my taste, I would have prefered a bit more space on the left and just a bit less on the right.', '2008-07-06 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
