(4808824, 685695, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image from my perspective as a retired architectural photographer. It''s simply doing an excellent job of capturing both form and surface in an abstract yet tangible way. Well done. It helps that I know the building, so I realize what you''ve accomplished.</td>', 'Outstanding image from my perspective as a retired architectural photographer. It''s simply doing an excellent job of capturing both form and surface in an abstract yet tangible way. Well done. It helps that I know the building, so I realize what you''ve accomplished.', '2008-07-07 10:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
