(4809672, 693627, 90658, '<td valign="top">Odd, but I liked this better in thumbnail.  Still great, but more impact smaller...who knew?!</td>', 'Odd, but I liked this better in thumbnail.  Still great, but more impact smaller...who knew?!', '2008-07-07 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809675, 693699, 90658, '<td valign="top">You know, your downfall is the fact that I gave this a second look.  Right at first I was blown away, then when I came in for the all-over closer look, I found it...the one thing that jumps out at me and now is all I can see.<br/> <br/>Your reflection in the "pearl"</td>', 'You know, your downfall is the fact that I gave this a second look.  Right at first I was blown away, then when I came in for the all-over closer look, I found it...the one thing that jumps out at me and now is all I can see. Your reflection in the "pearl"', '2008-07-07 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809679, 689894, 83416, '<td valign="top">Like your idea of the smiling eyes!</td>', 'Like your idea of the smiling eyes!', '2008-07-07 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
