(4809694, 693669, 90658, '<td valign="top">I love the effect of the muted tones in the white and the skin coloring here!  Here right eye (the one not under bangs--anatomical right) just explodes out of the shot.  There is a soft sensuality here that just brings me in and makes me want to find out what secret she is playing with.<br/> <br/>You might call this "Modern Mona Lisa."</td>', 'I love the effect of the muted tones in the white and the skin coloring here!  Here right eye (the one not under bangs--anatomical right) just explodes out of the shot.  There is a soft sensuality here that just brings me in and makes me want to find out what secret she is playing with. You might call this "Modern Mona Lisa."', '2008-07-07 18:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809698, 692948, 83416, '<td valign="top">Appears not in focus. Good luck!</td>', 'Appears not in focus. Good luck!', '2008-07-07 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809705, 689926, 90658, '<td valign="top">With this title, I''d expect some sort of emotion on the face of your subject.  She looks more contemplative than anything else.</td>', 'With this title, I''d expect some sort of emotion on the face of your subject.  She looks more contemplative than anything else.', '2008-07-07 18:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
