(4809716, 692802, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think I remember seeing something like this in one of the challenges.  It was one of my faves then just as this is now.  I love the perspective - I feel like I am in space and looking down at the earth.  Quite beautiful!</td>', 'I think I remember seeing something like this in one of the challenges.  It was one of my faves then just as this is now.  I love the perspective - I feel like I am in space and looking down at the earth.  Quite beautiful!', '2008-07-07 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
