(4809729, 693577, 30982, '<td valign="top">If I were to guess on this one I''d say grigrigirl.  But whoever it is, this is perfect.  A marvelous shot, excellent conversion.</td>', 'If I were to guess on this one I''d say grigrigirl.  But whoever it is, this is perfect.  A marvelous shot, excellent conversion.', '2008-07-07 18:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
