(4810510, 690975, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a message sent to me from another world. For a reason I cannot explain, I understand the alien script. It says Posthumous Blue.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is a message sent to me from another world. For a reason I cannot explain, I understand the alien script. It says Posthumous Blue. ', '2008-07-07 23:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
