(4810518, 693445, 28227, '<td valign="top">I can''t ever get these guys to sit still =)  A+ for the capture.. but I''d prefer to see it from the front.</td>', 'I can''t ever get these guys to sit still =)  A+ for the capture.. but I''d prefer to see it from the front.', '2008-07-07 23:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
