(4810994, 693808, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Makes you wonder why she''s there all alone and also as the viewer, I want to know what she is looking at.  Nice job capturing an interesting moment.</td>', 'Very cute.  Makes you wonder why she''s there all alone and also as the viewer, I want to know what she is looking at.  Nice job capturing an interesting moment.', '2008-07-08 01:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4810999, 693341, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really liked this.  I''m guessing some didn''t like her out of focus, but to me, that was perfect for this shot.  The focus, the shot, is him - not her.  And for me this works very well.  I even like the grain.  An excellent moment captured, a lousy score.</td>', 'I really liked this.  I''m guessing some didn''t like her out of focus, but to me, that was perfect for this shot.  The focus, the shot, is him - not her.  And for me this works very well.  I even like the grain.  An excellent moment captured, a lousy score.', '2008-07-08 01:27:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4811001, 692141, 30982, '<td valign="top">Got your dream score, got your top row placement!  This is a very well done HDR image - what gives it its strength is the very strong composition you started with.</td>', 'Got your dream score, got your top row placement!  This is a very well done HDR image - what gives it its strength is the very strong composition you started with.', '2008-07-08 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 0),
