(4811004, 693825, 61651, '<td valign="top">The frankness of the composition is what really makes the surreality of your subject go through the roof.  Made me think of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=523243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> image.</td>', 'The frankness of the composition is what really makes the surreality of your subject go through the roof.  Made me think of this image.', '2008-07-08 01:30:37.000000', NULL, 0),
