(4811263, 688693, 79955, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this scored so low. definitely underrated probably because it wasn''t too DPC friendly. Definitely should have scored higher , love this shot!!</td>', 'I am surprised this scored so low. definitely underrated probably because it wasn''t too DPC friendly. Definitely should have scored higher , love this shot!!', '2008-07-08 06:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
