(4811460, 690310, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me at least, DPC is a strange place.  I had this image and at least a dozen others rated much higher than mine - and deservedly so.  This is what photography is about.  This place is crazy when they don''t rate this image above a static nature shot such as mine.  Or maybe its just me - meaning trumps wow every time.  I love this and think you did really well with the editing, particularly concerning the circumstances. You should do it more often...</td>', 'For me at least, DPC is a strange place.  I had this image and at least a dozen others rated much higher than mine - and deservedly so.  This is what photography is about.  This place is crazy when they don''t rate this image above a static nature shot such as mine.  Or maybe its just me - meaning trumps wow every time.  I love this and think you did really well with the editing, particularly concerning the circumstances. You should do it more often...', '2008-07-08 09:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
