(4811700, 687871, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate deer shots, but this is wonderful. The intruding vegetation just makes the photo *more* intimate because I feel I am peeking in on something private. It is indeed a tender moment, a <i>Madonna Lactans</i>. But that''s not all: the composition is very energetic and fascinating for purely visual reasons. I gave this a 7, but really I underrated it. There were a lot of good shots in this challenge.</td>', 'I hate deer shots, but this is wonderful. The intruding vegetation just makes the photo *more* intimate because I feel I am peeking in on something private. It is indeed a tender moment, a Madonna Lactans. But that''s not all: the composition is very energetic and fascinating for purely visual reasons. I gave this a 7, but really I underrated it. There were a lot of good shots in this challenge.', '2008-07-08 12:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
