(4813788, 691978, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about being hard on yourself, because I dont think the haloing is bad at all (in fact given the fog it almost becomes part of the image)<br/> <br/>Great black and white conversion and I admire anyone who can capture fog this well because I sure cant.  I love the fact that we can look down and see the two houses, which really helps give a sense of size/height to the image<br/> <br/>Terrific</td>', 'Wow, talk about being hard on yourself, because I dont think the haloing is bad at all (in fact given the fog it almost becomes part of the image) Great black and white conversion and I admire anyone who can capture fog this well because I sure cant.  I love the fact that we can look down and see the two houses, which really helps give a sense of size/height to the image Terrific', '2008-07-09 04:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
