(4813808, 690469, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yeah yeah, I get it.  I take a macro of a dragonfly one month in Free Study, get a reasonable score and then the following month you go out and completely out do me in every way shape and form...Gee you know how to hurt a guy!<br/> <br/>Amazing image (though groaned at the title) just perfect in every way<br/> <br/>Brilliiant</td>', 'Yeah yeah, I get it.  I take a macro of a dragonfly one month in Free Study, get a reasonable score and then the following month you go out and completely out do me in every way shape and form...Gee you know how to hurt a guy! Amazing image (though groaned at the title) just perfect in every way Brilliiant', '2008-07-09 04:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813813, 693841, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow tremendous shot and as Michelle pointed out a 6+ in free study is nothing to be sneezed at<br/> <br/>Beautiful reflections and the richness of the colour almost gives the shot a tonemapped/HDR feel to it<br/> <br/>Looks like a wonderful place to get back to nature and the sort of image that makes me think ''I want to go there'' (although I would wonder what wildlife lurked in that water)<br/> <br/>ETA - Is that a knotted ''swing rope'' on the right of the shot if so you can become my hero by telling me that that was what you used to enter the water on the Sunday<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-09 03:59:02.</i></td>', 'Wow tremendous shot and as Michelle pointed out a 6+ in free study is nothing to be sneezed at Beautiful reflections and the richness of the colour almost gives the shot a tonemapped/HDR feel to it Looks like a wonderful place to get back to nature and the sort of image that makes me think ''I want to go there'' (although I would wonder what wildlife lurked in that water) ETA - Is that a knotted ''swing rope'' on the right of the shot if so you can become my hero by telling me that that was what you used to enter the water on the Sunday', '2008-07-09 04:57:47.000000', '2008-07-09 04:59:02.000000', 0),
