(4813892, 691188, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697253" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>I love the striking yellow and chrome of this and the way you have filled the frame with just a small part of the car, that really adds so much more appeal for me than just a standard shot of the whole car.</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  I love the striking yellow and chrome of this and the way you have filled the frame with just a small part of the car, that really adds so much more appeal for me than just a standard shot of the whole car.', '2008-07-09 07:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813893, 691726, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697251" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>I love the stopped motion action of this, the dirt spray is fantastic and gives me a great sense of motion, I can almost hear the engine screaming!! I like the tight crop, makes me feel part of the action. The bright colours of the bike and race wear also enhance this</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  I love the stopped motion action of this, the dirt spray is fantastic and gives me a great sense of motion, I can almost hear the engine screaming!! I like the tight crop, makes me feel part of the action. The bright colours of the bike and race wear also enhance this', '2008-07-09 07:04:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813894, 693258, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697252" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>I love the lighting in this, works perfectly for me ... having a pretty model doesn''t hurt either! The lines and patterns of the fence and walkway work really well for me and the dof is perfect. I also like the low level this is taken at and the position of the model<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-09 06:07:35.</i></td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  I love the lighting in this, works perfectly for me ... having a pretty model doesn''t hurt either! The lines and patterns of the fence and walkway work really well for me and the dof is perfect. I also like the low level this is taken at and the position of the model', '2008-07-09 07:06:33.000000', '2008-07-09 07:07:35.000000', 0),
