(4814490, 692795, 36606, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Debbi:</b></div><hr/><i> This is beautiful. I wish you had included the setup for this. As I recall the camera WB is set to florescent and a ''window green'' gel is added to the flash to create skies this color. It''s nice to share with everyone the technique.<br/> <br/>Debbi </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>nope, no setup like you explain. Simply a flash full power off camera. Colours are exactly as seen. no filters etc.</td>', 'Originally posted by Debbi: This is beautiful. I wish you had included the setup for this. As I recall the camera WB is set to florescent and a ''window green'' gel is added to the flash to create skies this color. It''s nice to share with everyone the technique. Debbi   nope, no setup like you explain. Simply a flash full power off camera. Colours are exactly as seen. no filters etc.', '2008-07-09 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
