(4814740, 693356, 90495, '<td valign="top">I like it for its lines and geometric shapes. Contrast is very high but it suits this structure I find. The shaded areas are very dark, I put the shade down to view it in darkness, but i''m afraid many will see it as completely black because they''re going to view it with the shades up, mostly. This could have lowered your score a bit. One last point, the subject matter is a bridge, although a majestic structure, we see them everyday and their effect is minimized because of this fact. You really would need to find a very bizarre angle to shoot it from for it to be more interesting for us viewers.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like it for its lines and geometric shapes. Contrast is very high but it suits this structure I find. The shaded areas are very dark, I put the shade down to view it in darkness, but i''m afraid many will see it as completely black because they''re going to view it with the shades up, mostly. This could have lowered your score a bit. One last point, the subject matter is a bridge, although a majestic structure, we see them everyday and their effect is minimized because of this fact. You really would need to find a very bizarre angle to shoot it from for it to be more interesting for us viewers. ', '2008-07-09 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4814851, 693697, 36999, '<td valign="top">Nope, not a blue eye, the sun just caught the exact right angle to light up a regular brown eye!</td>', 'Nope, not a blue eye, the sun just caught the exact right angle to light up a regular brown eye!', '2008-07-09 13:43:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4814925, 691952, 66193, '<td valign="top">beautiful image in every way.  it has a wonderful quality to the light, and I love all the textures here.  well done!</td>', 'beautiful image in every way.  it has a wonderful quality to the light, and I love all the textures here.  well done!', '2008-07-09 14:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4815007, 691954, 41357, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.<br/>about the picture<br/> <br/>The picture was taken the same day the gay parade took place in Jerusalem.<br/>Almost every year we have the same argument in Israel, should there be a gay parade in Jerusalem? one side saying that the gays have every right to parade just like any other citizens and the other side saying that a gay parade in Jerusalem is an insult to all three big religions and should not take place in the city of god.<br/>Last year I took some picture of the gay parade and this year I decided to go and take pictures of the orthodox Jews demonstration (they were both happening at the same time, in different parts of the city.)<br/>The main guy in the picture is a bit of a weirdo and all the kids were chasing after him (I think he is a bagger), he was trying to get rid of them and sometime he spoke or cursed at them. The funny thing was the language he used which was very old Hebrew. I think the guy thinks he lives in king David time.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.about the picture The picture was taken the same day the gay parade took place in Jerusalem.Almost every year we have the same argument in Israel, should there be a gay parade in Jerusalem? one side saying that the gays have every right to parade just like any other citizens and the other side saying that a gay parade in Jerusalem is an insult to all three big religions and should not take place in the city of god.Last year I took some picture of the gay parade and this year I decided to go and take pictures of the orthodox Jews demonstration (they were both happening at the same time, in different parts of the city.)The main guy in the picture is a bit of a weirdo and all the kids were chasing after him (I think he is a bagger), he was trying to get rid of them and sometime he spoke or cursed at them. The funny thing was the language he used which was very old Hebrew. I think the guy thinks he lives in king David time.', '2008-07-09 14:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4815016, 688686, 44877, '<td valign="top">OMG - this is so good, Charlene!! Absolutely brilliant - love it. What a fantastic use of reflections and lights - wow. The kicker is that he''s looking right at you - or so it seems. Very intense photo and great title. <br/> <br/>You should start doing some prints and get your stuff up on a wall somewhere. It''s wasted here.</td>', 'OMG - this is so good, Charlene!! Absolutely brilliant - love it. What a fantastic use of reflections and lights - wow. The kicker is that he''s looking right at you - or so it seems. Very intense photo and great title.  You should start doing some prints and get your stuff up on a wall somewhere. It''s wasted here.', '2008-07-09 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4815063, 688686, 61961, '<td valign="top">I love neon, interesting of you to desaturate it rather than punch it up which is the typical treatment.  Nice grainy quality overall.  I like the reflections behind the people, too.</td>', 'I love neon, interesting of you to desaturate it rather than punch it up which is the typical treatment.  Nice grainy quality overall.  I like the reflections behind the people, too.', '2008-07-09 15:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4815162, 693333, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought it was a lovely shot - very natural, lovely light.  The only thing I''d suggest is watching for things behind the bride that create an unnecessary division - the way the wall changes behind her obscures her hair a bit.  The part that''s behind her face, though, provides very nice texture.</td>', 'I thought it was a lovely shot - very natural, lovely light.  The only thing I''d suggest is watching for things behind the bride that create an unnecessary division - the way the wall changes behind her obscures her hair a bit.  The part that''s behind her face, though, provides very nice texture.', '2008-07-09 15:47:56.000000', NULL, 0),
