(4815385, 691726, 77287, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bobonacus:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697251" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>I love the stopped motion action of this, the dirt spray is fantastic and gives me a great sense of motion, I can almost hear the engine screaming!! I like the tight crop, makes me feel part of the action. The bright colours of the bike and race wear also enhance this </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Many thanks.<br/>That means a lot.<br/>Cheers<br/>B</td>', 'Originally posted by bobonacus:  from me in Posthumous Ribbons  I love the stopped motion action of this, the dirt spray is fantastic and gives me a great sense of motion, I can almost hear the engine screaming!! I like the tight crop, makes me feel part of the action. The bright colours of the bike and race wear also enhance this   Many thanks.That means a lot.CheersB', '2008-07-09 17:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
