(4817467, 689070, 66515, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. Sharp where it needs to be. Soft and glowing otherwise. I love the monochrome conversion - it really works well with this shot. Composition is interesting especially in the portrayal of depth.</td>', 'Love this shot. Sharp where it needs to be. Soft and glowing otherwise. I love the monochrome conversion - it really works well with this shot. Composition is interesting especially in the portrayal of depth.', '2008-07-10 15:24:24.000000', NULL, 0),
