(4820851, 690769, 66952, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Congrats on the 6.7.<br/> <br/>You did an amazing job of getting rid of the cage wires. I can still see it slightly in the final, but wouldn''t realize it was there if I hadn''t seen the original. The increased contrast and the sharpening are both just about right, too. I think I might have brightened the midtones just a bit, but maybe not....it''s good as is, really.</td>', 'Excellent! Congrats on the 6.7. You did an amazing job of getting rid of the cage wires. I can still see it slightly in the final, but wouldn''t realize it was there if I hadn''t seen the original. The increased contrast and the sharpening are both just about right, too. I think I might have brightened the midtones just a bit, but maybe not....it''s good as is, really.', '2008-07-12 13:34:11.000000', NULL, 0),
