(4824660, 692514, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this.  A lot, in fact.  There''s a wonderful sense of motion from the birds, of course, but I love how they''re completely unaware of the manufactured world around them, or so it seems to me.  And ignorant of the people on the right, who are also ignoring them.  Really very calming and somehow uplifting.</td>', 'I quite like this.  A lot, in fact.  There''s a wonderful sense of motion from the birds, of course, but I love how they''re completely unaware of the manufactured world around them, or so it seems to me.  And ignorant of the people on the right, who are also ignoring them.  Really very calming and somehow uplifting.', '2008-07-14 16:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
