(4824757, 687076, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the infectious smile!  Lovely portrait.  The white balance is a tad on the yellow side - I did a quick pass with a selective color layer, and took the yellow out of the red and yellow, then added a bit of cyan to both, and a bit of magenta to the yellow layer.  Adjusted the neutrals a touch, too (minus yellow, plus a nit of cyan, minus a nit of black).  Result is in my workshop for now:  [thumb]699167[/thumb]</td>', 'I love the infectious smile!  Lovely portrait.  The white balance is a tad on the yellow side - I did a quick pass with a selective color layer, and took the yellow out of the red and yellow, then added a bit of cyan to both, and a bit of magenta to the yellow layer.  Adjusted the neutrals a touch, too (minus yellow, plus a nit of cyan, minus a nit of black).  Result is in my workshop for now:  [thumb]699167[/thumb]', '2008-07-14 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4824981, 693797, 69325, '<td valign="top">damn the free studies....<br/>when i see what you can do with a camera and photoshop its kinda depressing, i don''t know how you get such rich, vivid colors.</td>', 'damn the free studies....when i see what you can do with a camera and photoshop its kinda depressing, i don''t know how you get such rich, vivid colors.', '2008-07-14 19:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4825144, 693558, 22551, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this photo!  Love the model - absolutely in love with the model. Love the composition. Love how the colors blend.  Great job!</td>', 'I love everything about this photo!  Love the model - absolutely in love with the model. Love the composition. Love how the colors blend.  Great job!', '2008-07-14 21:50:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4825251, 693810, 3936, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Color, Saturation, and Hue:  N/A image is monochrome.<br/> <br/>Brightness and contrast:  Contrast is good, brightness seems a little low.  <br/> <br/>Focus and depth of field:  Focus is nice and sharp, depth of field is excellent for this image.<br/> <br/>I think the biggest problem with this image has already been pointed out.  The eye came out dark and featureless.  Had the whites of the eye come out properly, I think this image would have scored much better.  When the eyes are not right, people tend to vote an image down.  (Evidently something must make them uneasy about odd looking eyes.)   <br/> <br/></td>', 'Critique Club Review: Color, Saturation, and Hue:  N/A image is monochrome. Brightness and contrast:  Contrast is good, brightness seems a little low.   Focus and depth of field:  Focus is nice and sharp, depth of field is excellent for this image. I think the biggest problem with this image has already been pointed out.  The eye came out dark and featureless.  Had the whites of the eye come out properly, I think this image would have scored much better.  When the eyes are not right, people tend to vote an image down.  (Evidently something must make them uneasy about odd looking eyes.)    ', '2008-07-14 22:32:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4825345, 686173, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi James,<br/>        Nice capture, I like the creative nature of the image. The sence of motion in the hands is nicely done. For me the image seems a little dark for my taste &amp; the brightness in the background just seems to clash with the overall image. The table &amp; chips are nice but a bit soft for me. I think with a few minor ajustments this would be a dynomite image.</td>', 'Hi James,        Nice capture, I like the creative nature of the image. The sence of motion in the hands is nicely done. For me the image seems a little dark for my taste & the brightness in the background just seems to clash with the overall image. The table & chips are nice but a bit soft for me. I think with a few minor ajustments this would be a dynomite image.', '2008-07-14 23:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4825393, 692976, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Robert,<br/>         The panning is some of the best I have seen here. The details in the car right down to the windshield whipper &amp; communications antena are fantastic. The sence of speed is also well detailed in the wheels. The colors are nice and natural looking, the image is clean, sharp &amp; well framed. The one thing imo that takes a bit from the image is it''s background. Not that it''s bad mind you, it just doesn''t do the image the justice it is do.</td>', 'Hi Robert,         The panning is some of the best I have seen here. The details in the car right down to the windshield whipper & communications antena are fantastic. The sence of speed is also well detailed in the wheels. The colors are nice and natural looking, the image is clean, sharp & well framed. The one thing imo that takes a bit from the image is it''s background. Not that it''s bad mind you, it just doesn''t do the image the justice it is do.', '2008-07-15 00:21:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4825818, 692802, 52115, '<td valign="top">I like this one. You slippied oned in.</td>', 'I like this one. You slippied oned in.', '2008-07-15 09:50:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4826871, 690504, 42013, '<td valign="top">Shucks! :(  Incredible stop motion shot! His feathers couldn''t be any more defined.</td>', 'Shucks! :(  Incredible stop motion shot! His feathers couldn''t be any more defined.', '2008-07-15 20:34:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827878, 693536, 58691, '<td valign="top">There is a wonderful intelligence in his stare - as though he is not studying the camera pointed at him, but the photographer, his purpose and possibly the outcome. A bit of anxiety maybe or apprehension that possibly, if necessary, could convert to anger in an outburst. The arms and legs look extremely strong, though not quite strong enough to free him from the uneasiness in his mind. Yet, the wrinkles in his face and hands portray a sound wisdom. Excellent capture.</td>', 'There is a wonderful intelligence in his stare - as though he is not studying the camera pointed at him, but the photographer, his purpose and possibly the outcome. A bit of anxiety maybe or apprehension that possibly, if necessary, could convert to anger in an outburst. The arms and legs look extremely strong, though not quite strong enough to free him from the uneasiness in his mind. Yet, the wrinkles in his face and hands portray a sound wisdom. Excellent capture.', '2008-07-16 03:06:37.000000', NULL, 0),
