(4837292, 692201, 30982, '<td valign="top">As I wander about in my role of "tourist", I find that it''s impossible to get some shots without cars or people.  I also find that those shots tend to be rather boring.  The cars and people, to me, add an interesting juxtaposition.  There''s the old, then there''s the here and now.  You got amazing detail in the bricks here, and did a very good job bringing out the clouds.</td>', 'As I wander about in my role of "tourist", I find that it''s impossible to get some shots without cars or people.  I also find that those shots tend to be rather boring.  The cars and people, to me, add an interesting juxtaposition.  There''s the old, then there''s the here and now.  You got amazing detail in the bricks here, and did a very good job bringing out the clouds.', '2008-07-21 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
