(4837576, 689408, 55838, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  What a wonderful moment captured so beautifully.  Great reflections and your processing is just right.  The diagonal suits this pic perfectly too.  Very well done.  Adding to fav''s.</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  What a wonderful moment captured so beautifully.  Great reflections and your processing is just right.  The diagonal suits this pic perfectly too.  Very well done.  Adding to fav''s.', '2008-07-21 21:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
