(4853150, 693780, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition (I like it, anyway), good DOF, and good light to shoot this.  The noise/grain - have you tried running it through a noise program like NeatImage?  This would blur the background flowers and even out the noise, giving a smoother, more polished look.  And for a flower in a FS, I''d say it did pretty well!</td>', 'Excellent composition (I like it, anyway), good DOF, and good light to shoot this.  The noise/grain - have you tried running it through a noise program like NeatImage?  This would blur the background flowers and even out the noise, giving a smoother, more polished look.  And for a flower in a FS, I''d say it did pretty well!', '2008-07-31 10:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4853222, 692145, 31738, '<td valign="top">Wow, great color.</td>', 'Wow, great color.', '2008-07-31 12:03:17.000000', NULL, 0),
