(4902090, 692659, 59029, '<td valign="top">Good shot, love the fisheye.  But her postion is terrible, she''s stiffing her poor worried horse in the mouth, and he''s pedalling over the fence that she got him far too deep into.  If she were one of my students, she wouldn''t even be jumping.</td>', 'Good shot, love the fisheye.  But her postion is terrible, she''s stiffing her poor worried horse in the mouth, and he''s pedalling over the fence that she got him far too deep into.  If she were one of my students, she wouldn''t even be jumping.', '2008-08-21 07:07:28.000000', NULL, 0),
