(5114597, 691547, 11843, '<td valign="top">Ooooo! I like this one better! The color really stands out. Looks like I gave you a 7 during the challenge, but I don''t comment much anymore. Looking at it again, on closer inspection, I''d give it a 9! Great work.</td>', 'Ooooo! I like this one better! The color really stands out. Looks like I gave you a 7 during the challenge, but I don''t comment much anymore. Looking at it again, on closer inspection, I''d give it a 9! Great work.', '2008-12-07 18:40:12.000000', NULL, 0),
